    section1Title: "What this covers",
    section1Body: "This service covers the groom's dedicated pagdi session, coordinated family pagdis and faster baraati safa tying, all planned around one preparation room. Fabric, fold and finishing are agreed before the team travels, so nothing is decided on the spot.",
    section2Title: "How to book",
    section2Body: "To book, share your event date, exact venue, total headcount and any outfit or décor references. We'll confirm artist availability and recommend a realistic package within one conversation.",
